(2131704, 289934, 51552, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of people using borders like this. I wonder how good an image is if putting a nice frame around it makes it look much nicer, yknow?</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of people using borders like this. I wonder how good an image is if putting a nice frame around it makes it look much nicer, yknow?', '2006-02-08 00:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
