(2131726, 292769, 51552, '<td valign="top">It is a little underexposed for my taste, though the composition and what you chose to include in the shot seem fantastic. I think you should''ve tried more shots and gotten a more exposed image, and boosted the contrast.</td>', 'It is a little underexposed for my taste, though the composition and what you chose to include in the shot seem fantastic. I think you should''ve tried more shots and gotten a more exposed image, and boosted the contrast.', '2006-02-08 00:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2131734, 292153, 50231, '<td valign="top">Yup worst hand in poker. Great Idea.</td>', 'Yup worst hand in poker. Great Idea.', '2006-02-08 00:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2131737, 292855, 51552, '<td valign="top">I like the cup, and I think if perhaps you could''ve done a shot where you isolated the subject of the cup more. perhaps JUST the cup in focus, and then an indescript kitchen background behind it. The Folgers thing just kind of detracts from the image, and makes the colors feel dull.</td>', 'I like the cup, and I think if perhaps you could''ve done a shot where you isolated the subject of the cup more. perhaps JUST the cup in focus, and then an indescript kitchen background behind it. The Folgers thing just kind of detracts from the image, and makes the colors feel dull.', '2006-02-08 00:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
