(2132414, 292189, 50641, '<td valign="top">Ooh, I have one like that too. Good idea!  Good composition. I like your concentric circles and scratched silver bowls, chromey monochromatics. Very pleasing as is, but I bet this will be fun for you to enhance further once free of the basic editing rules.</td>', 'Ooh, I have one like that too. Good idea!  Good composition. I like your concentric circles and scratched silver bowls, chromey monochromatics. Very pleasing as is, but I bet this will be fun for you to enhance further once free of the basic editing rules.', '2006-02-08 02:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
