(2133718, 292601, 20651, '<td valign="top">It''s almost too precisely laid out to look "broken"... I like the use of color, though.</td>', 'It''s almost too precisely laid out to look "broken"... I like the use of color, though.', '2006-02-08 12:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133725, 292091, 52296, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2006-02-08 12:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133727, 292484, 39988, '<td valign="top">ooph</td>', 'ooph', '2006-02-08 12:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133731, 292151, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a long exposure to create quite an ethereal effect in the water. And well planned/ timed to catch the light so that there is detail and colour in the main subject and also in the clouds and sky. Great composition too.</td>', 'Nice use of a long exposure to create quite an ethereal effect in the water. And well planned/ timed to catch the light so that there is detail and colour in the main subject and also in the clouds and sky. Great composition too.', '2006-02-08 12:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133734, 292022, 3087, '<td valign="top">Now THIS is a clever twist on Ben''s original love filter idea! Clever one!</td>', 'Now THIS is a clever twist on Ben''s original love filter idea! Clever one!', '2006-02-08 12:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133736, 290047, 30950, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and textures...</td>', 'Nice tones and textures...', '2006-02-08 12:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133740, 292031, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful texture, colours and composition and I like this take on the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful texture, colours and composition and I like this take on the challenge.', '2006-02-08 12:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133741, 292091, 20651, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I love the use of color, motion, etc!  Great treatment of an idea that could easily be cliche.</td>', 'Wow!  I love the use of color, motion, etc!  Great treatment of an idea that could easily be cliche.', '2006-02-08 12:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133747, 292191, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail study and great close up crop. Love that row of colourful rusted nailheads and the beautiful texture of the worn, white wood. Use of diagonals and lines is excellent. I like this very much indeed.</td>', 'Lovely detail study and great close up crop. Love that row of colourful rusted nailheads and the beautiful texture of the worn, white wood. Use of diagonals and lines is excellent. I like this very much indeed.', '2006-02-08 12:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133751, 291458, 3087, '<td valign="top">Clever idea to convey the weakness of quick bandaid patches to larger problems. I like this but the composition is rather static/ centred. I wonder if a non-centred composition would strengthen this or not?</td>', 'Clever idea to convey the weakness of quick bandaid patches to larger problems. I like this but the composition is rather static/ centred. I wonder if a non-centred composition would strengthen this or not?', '2006-02-08 12:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133752, 292830, 52296, '<td valign="top">I love the humor in this picture and it''s well executed too, good work.</td>', 'I love the humor in this picture and it''s well executed too, good work.', '2006-02-08 12:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133753, 292872, 39988, '<td valign="top">simple and obvious yet provocative</td>', 'simple and obvious yet provocative', '2006-02-08 12:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133754, 291308, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oh I do love shallow DOF and low down perspectives and this has both! Nice composition with bottle rim off centre. Some detail in the shells. Interesting.</td>', 'Oh I do love shallow DOF and low down perspectives and this has both! Nice composition with bottle rim off centre. Some detail in the shells. Interesting.', '2006-02-08 12:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133758, 291575, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a scary image! Nice use of light and shadow to enhance what is already there in the subject and the red background colour helps too. Dark, frightening, clever image.</td>', 'What a scary image! Nice use of light and shadow to enhance what is already there in the subject and the red background colour helps too. Dark, frightening, clever image.', '2006-02-08 12:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133759, 291161, 20651, '<td valign="top">The people in the background are distracting and the deer (deer?) seems a bit out of focus.</td>', 'The people in the background are distracting and the deer (deer?) seems a bit out of focus.', '2006-02-08 12:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133768, 291428, 3087, '<td valign="top">Simple, minimal and one cannot possibly miss the message. Is the pink colour cast deliberate? I''m not keen on it. Otherwise, like the image overall.</td>', 'Simple, minimal and one cannot possibly miss the message. Is the pink colour cast deliberate? I''m not keen on it. Otherwise, like the image overall.', '2006-02-08 12:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133773, 292849, 20651, '<td valign="top">Was that a playhouse?  It looks like exactly the thing that I would have LOVED as a child-- fixer upper and all!  I''m curious about the "spot" you''re referring to in the title-- the white paint on the red support?  Cool concept, but wish the colors popped a bit more.</td>', 'Was that a playhouse?  It looks like exactly the thing that I would have LOVED as a child-- fixer upper and all!  I''m curious about the "spot" you''re referring to in the title-- the white paint on the red support?  Cool concept, but wish the colors popped a bit more.', '2006-02-08 12:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133775, 291817, 33947, '<td valign="top">Good idea. If only there had been more contrast I could have given more points. On my monitor many of the shells are almost lost to the background. 5</td>', 'Good idea. If only there had been more contrast I could have given more points. On my monitor many of the shells are almost lost to the background. 5', '2006-02-08 12:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
