(2134649, 289723, 24454, '<td valign="top">I think this is a powerful photo.  I like the misty look to it a lot!  Compositionally, I wish she wasn''t so dead-centered.   I think a little more negative space on the left side of the photo -- and less on the right -  would have added even more impact.  But I really love this, and its one of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'I think this is a powerful photo.  I like the misty look to it a lot!  Compositionally, I wish she wasn''t so dead-centered.   I think a little more negative space on the left side of the photo -- and less on the right -  would have added even more impact.  But I really love this, and its one of my favorites in this challenge.', '2006-02-08 16:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134653, 292830, 37851, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful! My only 10 in this challenge.  I hope you get a ribbon.</td>', 'This is wonderful! My only 10 in this challenge.  I hope you get a ribbon.', '2006-02-08 16:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
