(2134753, 292022, 48528, '<td valign="top">WOW</td>', 'WOW', '2006-02-08 16:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134774, 292388, 30608, '<td valign="top">There are lots of details of many objects in this photo which causes you to study the photo more deeply. The windows, ladder, welder. Great contrast and hues. Then you start thinking about where this broken train has been in it''s working lifetime.</td>', 'There are lots of details of many objects in this photo which causes you to study the photo more deeply. The windows, ladder, welder. Great contrast and hues. Then you start thinking about where this broken train has been in it''s working lifetime.', '2006-02-08 16:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134776, 291055, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this one.  I love the fill-the-frame composition.  Great job.</td>', 'I love this one.  I love the fill-the-frame composition.  Great job.', '2006-02-08 16:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134778, 292647, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great focus, nice even lighting that really allows the colours and textures to come through but provides enough shadow to show depth and dimension. <br/> <br/>At first glance I thought, hmmm, way too literal an interpretation of the challenge topic, just some broken junk and that''s it. After some moments I realised that there is much more here - an entire mystery or story about someone who has either abandoned or been forced to abandon a much loved hobby or perhaps this is all that''s left behind of someone who loved to fish but is no longer with us. I wonder if other viewers will see that?<br/> <br/>Weakness: Lack of composition/ aesthetic appeal.</td>', 'Great focus, nice even lighting that really allows the colours and textures to come through but provides enough shadow to show depth and dimension.  At first glance I thought, hmmm, way too literal an interpretation of the challenge topic, just some broken junk and that''s it. After some moments I realised that there is much more here - an entire mystery or story about someone who has either abandoned or been forced to abandon a much loved hobby or perhaps this is all that''s left behind of someone who loved to fish but is no longer with us. I wonder if other viewers will see that? Weakness: Lack of composition/ aesthetic appeal.', '2006-02-08 16:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134779, 291458, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is a creative, great idea.  And very well-executed.  I wonder if the rule of thirds. . .or making a little less dead-center would have given it even more impact ???  I like it alot tho.</td>', 'This is a creative, great idea.  And very well-executed.  I wonder if the rule of thirds. . .or making a little less dead-center would have given it even more impact ???  I like it alot tho.', '2006-02-08 16:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134792, 292882, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea for broken. Who doesn''t love to look at rich looking chocolate.   I wish it were sharper -- then it would be perfect.</td>', 'This is a great idea for broken. Who doesn''t love to look at rich looking chocolate.   I wish it were sharper -- then it would be perfect.', '2006-02-08 16:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
