(2136364, 292882, 52928, '<td valign="top">When I saw the thumbnail for this I had high hopes for this - it is certainly a good idea. I''m new to DPC and haven''t seen much of others work yet but there are a few things that spoil this for me ...<br/> <br/>1. It''s out of focus<br/>2. The lesser red marks to the left and underneath the chocolate are distracting<br/>3. The contents of the chocolate don''t have any room to flow into - might have been better to leave more space to the right and below for this.</td>', 'When I saw the thumbnail for this I had high hopes for this - it is certainly a good idea. I''m new to DPC and haven''t seen much of others work yet but there are a few things that spoil this for me ... 1. It''s out of focus2. The lesser red marks to the left and underneath the chocolate are distracting3. The contents of the chocolate don''t have any room to flow into - might have been better to leave more space to the right and below for this.', '2006-02-09 08:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
