(2139175, 292544, 28963, '<td valign="top">An ok portrait, I don''t really see that it fits the challenge though. Also I find that the fact that the head is tilted downwards is a bit disturbing for my own balance. The lighting is a bit too harsh as well. There is a shadow on her face and eyes which is generally a big no no when it comes to portraits.</td>', 'An ok portrait, I don''t really see that it fits the challenge though. Also I find that the fact that the head is tilted downwards is a bit disturbing for my own balance. The lighting is a bit too harsh as well. There is a shadow on her face and eyes which is generally a big no no when it comes to portraits.', '2006-02-10 03:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139178, 291347, 28963, '<td valign="top">Cool composition! I would have liked to see some more life in the broken galss though, it blends too much with the bakground for me. It might be your goal, but I find that it reduces the overall image.</td>', 'Cool composition! I would have liked to see some more life in the broken galss though, it blends too much with the bakground for me. It might be your goal, but I find that it reduces the overall image.', '2006-02-10 03:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139181, 291876, 28963, '<td valign="top">Very harsh shadows and a taad overexposed for my taste. Also I think that maybe if you had taken a bit of a different angel on the house ot would have helped the composition considerably.</td>', 'Very harsh shadows and a taad overexposed for my taste. Also I think that maybe if you had taken a bit of a different angel on the house ot would have helped the composition considerably.', '2006-02-10 03:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139192, 292575, 53122, '<td valign="top">Im in the middle on this. I like the composition, but it for some reason seems a little flat. I''m just being a bit picky. I think there is just a bit much foreground. Overall it''s a great shot.</td>', 'Im in the middle on this. I like the composition, but it for some reason seems a little flat. I''m just being a bit picky. I think there is just a bit much foreground. Overall it''s a great shot.', '2006-02-10 03:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139196, 292290, 53122, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this. It''s romantic. I went to art school, and I know a lot of detailed ideas of what it could represent often turns people off -- especially myself. However, I love the colors, and the lighting is just wonderful. It reminds me of the feeling of being dumped. My first 10!</td>', 'I LOVE this. It''s romantic. I went to art school, and I know a lot of detailed ideas of what it could represent often turns people off -- especially myself. However, I love the colors, and the lighting is just wonderful. It reminds me of the feeling of being dumped. My first 10!', '2006-02-10 03:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139200, 292578, 53122, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea, but the colors don''t entirely work for me. That''s not so much your fault as it is the overcast sky. I say great attempt, and go for it when you have some sun to bring out some more of the dramatic qualities of the riverbank.</td>', 'I really like the idea, but the colors don''t entirely work for me. That''s not so much your fault as it is the overcast sky. I say great attempt, and go for it when you have some sun to bring out some more of the dramatic qualities of the riverbank.', '2006-02-10 03:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139202, 292876, 53122, '<td valign="top">I played trumpet in HS band for awhile. This is exactly how it made me feel.</td>', 'I played trumpet in HS band for awhile. This is exactly how it made me feel.', '2006-02-10 03:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139205, 289810, 53122, '<td valign="top">A little bit too much contrast, but an excellent idea.</td>', 'A little bit too much contrast, but an excellent idea.', '2006-02-10 03:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
