(2139209, 292882, 53122, '<td valign="top">Oh I like this a lot. The only complaint I have is that I wish more of the cherry was in focus, esp. the pooling goo in front. I still love it though.</td>', 'Oh I like this a lot. The only complaint I have is that I wish more of the cherry was in focus, esp. the pooling goo in front. I still love it though.', '2006-02-10 03:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139214, 291897, 53122, '<td valign="top">Oh don''t say too simple! I love this. Sometimes when things are over-thought they look that way. You nailed this with something really natural. I like the composition a lot too, esp. the branches across the back. The fact that they lead into the focal point helps to keep the image from bouncing all over the place. There is a lot to look at, but you managed to lock me in to what you wanted me to see. Success!</td>', 'Oh don''t say too simple! I love this. Sometimes when things are over-thought they look that way. You nailed this with something really natural. I like the composition a lot too, esp. the branches across the back. The fact that they lead into the focal point helps to keep the image from bouncing all over the place. There is a lot to look at, but you managed to lock me in to what you wanted me to see. Success!', '2006-02-10 03:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
