(2139407, 292802, 52928, '<td valign="top">First impression is that the horizon is a little off - but I''m not sure if that is an optical illusion!?  There also appears to be a stray branch/blade of grass just above the tank that looks a little odd.  I would have been tempted to crop most of the top of the picture out as there is little of interest in it, but perhaps you tried this and decided the trees would not look right.</td>', 'First impression is that the horizon is a little off - but I''m not sure if that is an optical illusion!?  There also appears to be a stray branch/blade of grass just above the tank that looks a little odd.  I would have been tempted to crop most of the top of the picture out as there is little of interest in it, but perhaps you tried this and decided the trees would not look right.', '2006-02-10 06:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139409, 292435, 52928, '<td valign="top">An interesting effect, showing the sky via reflection in the water. I also seem to have trouble focussing my eye on some parts of the image and I''m not sure whether this is something to do with the focus of the image itself?</td>', 'An interesting effect, showing the sky via reflection in the water. I also seem to have trouble focussing my eye on some parts of the image and I''m not sure whether this is something to do with the focus of the image itself?', '2006-02-10 06:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139427, 292806, 52928, '<td valign="top">Something about the left part of the egg being seen from the outside, rather than from the inside does not seem quite as natural somehow, compared to some of the other challenge entries - however I could believe that this was the way it broke.  The colours and texture of the albumen have been captured well, but the shadow/dampness to the left looks a bit fake.</td>', 'Something about the left part of the egg being seen from the outside, rather than from the inside does not seem quite as natural somehow, compared to some of the other challenge entries - however I could believe that this was the way it broke.  The colours and texture of the albumen have been captured well, but the shadow/dampness to the left looks a bit fake.', '2006-02-10 06:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139431, 292876, 52928, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting - makes you look twice to see what''s wrong with it.</td>', 'Nice lighting - makes you look twice to see what''s wrong with it.', '2006-02-10 06:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
