(2139461, 290158, 52928, '<td valign="top">I think I would have been tempted to crop more off the top of the photo.  (The title did have me worried before I saw the image itself!)</td>', 'I think I would have been tempted to crop more off the top of the photo.  (The title did have me worried before I saw the image itself!)', '2006-02-10 06:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139477, 292823, 52928, '<td valign="top">There is something really intriguing about the immaculate brickwork and pointing right next to this window. It really makes you wonder what''s going on here.  I don''t know what lay outside the frame, but it the entire wall was this good and all the window was in the same state, it would have been interesting to see the whole window off-centre within the good wall.</td>', 'There is something really intriguing about the immaculate brickwork and pointing right next to this window. It really makes you wonder what''s going on here.  I don''t know what lay outside the frame, but it the entire wall was this good and all the window was in the same state, it would have been interesting to see the whole window off-centre within the good wall.', '2006-02-10 07:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139478, 291513, 29474, '<td valign="top">An extra point because it is not a tumble-down building, abandoned car or weather ravaged tree.<br/> <br/>The shadows are a bit harsh, but the sharpness is great.</td>', 'An extra point because it is not a tumble-down building, abandoned car or weather ravaged tree. The shadows are a bit harsh, but the sharpness is great.', '2006-02-10 07:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
