(2139854, 292805, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s always interesting to see when more than 1 person runs across the same exact item to enter for a challenge (see ''Boulevard of broken trucks'' entry).  ;^)  For sure this is a compelling subject and fun to look at.  The lighting in this version is much more appealing, natural and not harsh.  Good job on bringing out the details inside the cab.  This angle/composition works well as the building to the left has been eliminated and therefore the distraction removed.  7<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s always interesting to see when more than 1 person runs across the same exact item to enter for a challenge (see ''Boulevard of broken trucks'' entry).  ;^)  For sure this is a compelling subject and fun to look at.  The lighting in this version is much more appealing, natural and not harsh.  Good job on bringing out the details inside the cab.  This angle/composition works well as the building to the left has been eliminated and therefore the distraction removed.  7 Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-02-10 10:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139855, 290613, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s always interesting to see when more than 1 person runs across the same exact item to enter for a challenge (see Aged entry).  ;^)  For sure this is a compelling subject and fun to look at.  This version has some issues with lighting as I find it a bit harsh (looks like flash was used).  Too much of the subject in this seems to be the steering wheel. 4<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s always interesting to see when more than 1 person runs across the same exact item to enter for a challenge (see Aged entry).  ;^)  For sure this is a compelling subject and fun to look at.  This version has some issues with lighting as I find it a bit harsh (looks like flash was used).  Too much of the subject in this seems to be the steering wheel. 4 Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-02-10 10:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139857, 292885, 51759, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo. Good depth of field and framing. I was particularly pleased to find a photo in this category that wasn''t morose and full of angst.</td>', 'Fantastic photo. Good depth of field and framing. I was particularly pleased to find a photo in this category that wasn''t morose and full of angst.', '2006-02-10 10:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139862, 291240, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge theme.  I like it.  Do wish the paper was illuminated a little better.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge theme.  I like it.  Do wish the paper was illuminated a little better.', '2006-02-10 10:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139865, 292610, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice potential here...a little too dark to break an above avg score I''m afraid.</td>', 'Nice potential here...a little too dark to break an above avg score I''m afraid.', '2006-02-10 10:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
