(2139872, 292647, 30049, '<td valign="top">Step away from the reel...go to the store...buy ANYTHING but a bait-casting reel!  ;^)  You have to either love em, or hate em.<br/> <br/>Great concept for this challenge.  Wonderful lighting and nice crisp focus.  I''ll bet you brought the beach inside for this one didn''t you?  He-he.  That''s cool.  Well done. 9</td>', 'Step away from the reel...go to the store...buy ANYTHING but a bait-casting reel!  ;^)  You have to either love em, or hate em. Great concept for this challenge.  Wonderful lighting and nice crisp focus.  I''ll bet you brought the beach inside for this one didn''t you?  He-he.  That''s cool.  Well done. 9', '2006-02-10 10:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139873, 290540, 51759, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. The focus is sufficiently narrow (that is, the focus of the photo, not the camera''s focus) that the image doesn''t convey an emotion of utter sadness, but instead an emotion of simple cause and consequence.</td>', 'Interesting subject. The focus is sufficiently narrow (that is, the focus of the photo, not the camera''s focus) that the image doesn''t convey an emotion of utter sadness, but instead an emotion of simple cause and consequence.', '2006-02-10 10:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139874, 290523, 52928, '<td valign="top">Generally with portraits the eyes are the most important thing to get in focus, and I''m afraid this is something that you did not manage.</td>', 'Generally with portraits the eyes are the most important thing to get in focus, and I''m afraid this is something that you did not manage.', '2006-02-10 10:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
