(2139894, 290413, 52928, '<td valign="top">I can see that you''ve interpreted the theme but there doesn''t seem to be any story behind this - other that the title suggesting something.  Perhaps you could have had a single broken pot amongst a set of live pots to set off the contrast more.</td>', 'I can see that you''ve interpreted the theme but there doesn''t seem to be any story behind this - other that the title suggesting something.  Perhaps you could have had a single broken pot amongst a set of live pots to set off the contrast more.', '2006-02-10 10:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139901, 291149, 52928, '<td valign="top">Your figurine doesn''t appear to be quite in focus and doesn''t really tell a story (except where you try and add one via the title). Hopefully you didn''t break your mum''s favourite piece just to enter the competition.</td>', 'Your figurine doesn''t appear to be quite in focus and doesn''t really tell a story (except where you try and add one via the title). Hopefully you didn''t break your mum''s favourite piece just to enter the competition.', '2006-02-10 10:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139907, 289912, 52928, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why you would have put the entire photo out of focus on purpose.  The cupboard appears to be the thing you''re trying suggest is broken - or are you suggesting the camera is too?</td>', 'I''m not sure why you would have put the entire photo out of focus on purpose.  The cupboard appears to be the thing you''re trying suggest is broken - or are you suggesting the camera is too?', '2006-02-10 10:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139910, 292110, 52928, '<td valign="top">Looks like the high-key effect has been applied too strongly that this has affected the detail of the orange.</td>', 'Looks like the high-key effect has been applied too strongly that this has affected the detail of the orange.', '2006-02-10 10:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139912, 289836, 31541, '<td valign="top">Hi.  This one was tough.  I like the shadowy figures in the background and the composition itself, but the subject (corn stalk?) is a little too dark.  I realize it''s tough to light from that side of the sun.  Perhaps if more was backlit (like the bottom of it was).</td>', 'Hi.  This one was tough.  I like the shadowy figures in the background and the composition itself, but the subject (corn stalk?) is a little too dark.  I realize it''s tough to light from that side of the sun.  Perhaps if more was backlit (like the bottom of it was).', '2006-02-10 10:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2139914, 292888, 52928, '<td valign="top">You''ve really put the background out of focus well, to draw the eyes to the plant.  I think I would have liked more of the buds to have been in focus and ideally for you to have found a more colourful specimen.</td>', 'You''ve really put the background out of focus well, to draw the eyes to the plant.  I think I would have liked more of the buds to have been in focus and ideally for you to have found a more colourful specimen.', '2006-02-10 10:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
