(2141819, 291978, 18799, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture.  It looks like you are photographing from inside a prison.</td>', 'Interesting picture.  It looks like you are photographing from inside a prison.', '2006-02-11 00:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141826, 292558, 18799, '<td valign="top">Great image and nice choice on the color conversion.</td>', 'Great image and nice choice on the color conversion.', '2006-02-11 00:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141840, 292810, 18799, '<td valign="top">interesting compostion.  My first thought when I opening the image was there wasn''t enough information to convince me this met the broken challenge.  But the more I looked at the compostion, the more I was convinced that it does a great job of communicating the message and meets the challenge very well.  Are you  confused yet?  OK, how about a 9?</td>', 'interesting compostion.  My first thought when I opening the image was there wasn''t enough information to convince me this met the broken challenge.  But the more I looked at the compostion, the more I was convinced that it does a great job of communicating the message and meets the challenge very well.  Are you  confused yet?  OK, how about a 9?', '2006-02-11 00:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141841, 291790, 18799, '<td valign="top">I like this take on the challenge.   There are a lot of challenges that I''ve wished I could go into the local salvage yard to take pictures for but they won''t let me.   8</td>', 'I like this take on the challenge.   There are a lot of challenges that I''ve wished I could go into the local salvage yard to take pictures for but they won''t let me.   8', '2006-02-11 00:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141844, 292187, 18799, '<td valign="top">I like a lot of things about this image, but one thing that bothers me a lot is that the person''s eyeball is cut in half.   Cutting features like this is generally considered a compositional no-no, and in this case, I agree.  Still, for the other strengths of the image, a 7 from me.</td>', 'I like a lot of things about this image, but one thing that bothers me a lot is that the person''s eyeball is cut in half.   Cutting features like this is generally considered a compositional no-no, and in this case, I agree.  Still, for the other strengths of the image, a 7 from me.', '2006-02-11 00:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141849, 291240, 18799, '<td valign="top">While it''s a bit contrived, it is also done very well.  I love the out of focus and backlit effect you have created here.  9</td>', 'While it''s a bit contrived, it is also done very well.  I love the out of focus and backlit effect you have created here.  9', '2006-02-11 00:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141851, 292830, 18799, '<td valign="top">This is great.  The partial face of the cat is brilliant.  10</td>', 'This is great.  The partial face of the cat is brilliant.  10', '2006-02-11 00:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
