(2141871, 290047, 18799, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I would never get broken from this image.  While a good still life of shoes, I don''t think it is particularly strong for this topic.  5</td>', 'Without the title, I would never get broken from this image.  While a good still life of shoes, I don''t think it is particularly strong for this topic.  5', '2006-02-11 00:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
