(2141885, 292499, 42638, '<td valign="top">Ouch! This is a very sad picture. Good composition but sad subject. I wouldn''t doubt if every photogropher just cringed when they saw this. Nicely done!</td>', 'Ouch! This is a very sad picture. Good composition but sad subject. I wouldn''t doubt if every photogropher just cringed when they saw this. Nicely done!', '2006-02-11 00:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
