(2141888, 292745, 42638, '<td valign="top">Good picture. I like the harsh lines made but the edges of broken glass. Nice simple colors really compliment each other.</td>', 'Good picture. I like the harsh lines made but the edges of broken glass. Nice simple colors really compliment each other.', '2006-02-11 00:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
