(2142176, 292558, 18073, '<td valign="top">You have found a great subject here but I feel you haven''t made the most of the opportunity.  I find the background very distracting and the centered composition a little plain.  However you have captured a lot of great detail and the sepia also works well.</td>', 'You have found a great subject here but I feel you haven''t made the most of the opportunity.  I find the background very distracting and the centered composition a little plain.  However you have captured a lot of great detail and the sepia also works well.', '2006-02-11 07:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
