(2143831, 290575, 34938, '<td valign="top">nice work...perhaps the water blur is too strong and shooting at a quicker shutter speed might have caught a little more movement because the water now looks out of focus and not motion blurred if you know what I mean...it''s also a messy composition with distracting branches and could have been captured better from another vantage point</td>', 'nice work...perhaps the water blur is too strong and shooting at a quicker shutter speed might have caught a little more movement because the water now looks out of focus and not motion blurred if you know what I mean...it''s also a messy composition with distracting branches and could have been captured better from another vantage point', '2006-02-12 02:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2143833, 292135, 34938, '<td valign="top">nice lighting</td>', 'nice lighting', '2006-02-12 02:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
