(2144575, 291240, 53247, '<td valign="top">Fantastic concept, I get the darkness is to convey dark times, but, its too dark.  Specifically, the letter and rings should be lightened for a better effect.  <br/> <br/>p.s. Just so you know I am a professional photographer so take my comments as a compliment!  :)</td>', 'Fantastic concept, I get the darkness is to convey dark times, but, its too dark.  Specifically, the letter and rings should be lightened for a better effect.   p.s. Just so you know I am a professional photographer so take my comments as a compliment!  :)', '2006-02-12 14:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2144580, 290933, 53247, '<td valign="top">LOL!!! So True!</td>', 'LOL!!! So True!', '2006-02-12 14:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2144583, 289837, 51941, '<td valign="top">Time to put this horse to rest!!!!  Great subject and composition!!!  It brings back memories of when my children were young!!</td>', 'Time to put this horse to rest!!!!  Great subject and composition!!!  It brings back memories of when my children were young!!', '2006-02-12 14:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2144584, 292094, 53247, '<td valign="top">Wow, Excellent! I can feel the childs pain.</td>', 'Wow, Excellent! I can feel the childs pain.', '2006-02-12 14:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2144586, 291428, 53248, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, I think the colors really work for this image.</td>', 'Very pretty, I think the colors really work for this image.', '2006-02-12 14:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
