(2144593, 292613, 53248, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful imagery, the black and white really work for this. This is a feat for basic editing :)</td>', 'Very beautiful imagery, the black and white really work for this. This is a feat for basic editing :)', '2006-02-12 15:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
