(2144641, 291539, 53249, '<td valign="top">This photo really pulls me in somehow, it may just be because when I moved to this town, the one I''ve lived in for seven years, the first friends I got were from a Reid family and of course the name is the first thing you look for on a photo like this.</td>', 'This photo really pulls me in somehow, it may just be because when I moved to this town, the one I''ve lived in for seven years, the first friends I got were from a Reid family and of course the name is the first thing you look for on a photo like this.', '2006-02-12 15:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2144643, 291998, 53247, '<td valign="top">Like the color combinations!</td>', 'Like the color combinations!', '2006-02-12 15:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2144646, 291915, 53249, '<td valign="top">This, I really don''t understand, then again, I am very new to photo judging and I seem to have problems reading any deeper then face value on some things. I guess this just happened to be one of them. Still, photo-wise, this seems a pretty nice one.</td>', 'This, I really don''t understand, then again, I am very new to photo judging and I seem to have problems reading any deeper then face value on some things. I guess this just happened to be one of them. Still, photo-wise, this seems a pretty nice one.', '2006-02-12 15:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
