(2144653, 291149, 53249, '<td valign="top">I must say, my favorite part of this photo would have to be the title for me. All in all though, very nice.</td>', 'I must say, my favorite part of this photo would have to be the title for me. All in all though, very nice.', '2006-02-12 15:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
