(2144717, 290523, 28963, '<td valign="top">Are you having an experiment seeing how many challenges you can enter with a portrait vaiation of your/models face? Just curious. If you are then I am really excited to see the results.<br/>If not, I didn''t mean to hurt your feelings. Didn''t vote on this one.</td>', 'Are you having an experiment seeing how many challenges you can enter with a portrait vaiation of your/models face? Just curious. If you are then I am really excited to see the results.If not, I didn''t mean to hurt your feelings. Didn''t vote on this one.', '2006-02-12 16:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2144719, 292876, 28963, '<td valign="top">Great feeling from ths photo. The lighting is perfect. 10</td>', 'Great feeling from ths photo. The lighting is perfect. 10', '2006-02-12 16:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2144720, 292091, 28963, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Greaet exposure for the glasses. If it was leagal I would have tried to remove the drops that are already on the table/surface. Love the two colours of the fluid. Bumping up.</td>', 'Great shot. Greaet exposure for the glasses. If it was leagal I would have tried to remove the drops that are already on the table/surface. Love the two colours of the fluid. Bumping up.', '2006-02-12 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
