(2144963, 290083, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice subject for black &amp; white.  I''d try and straighten it out a little.  Everything is slipping to the right.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-17 21:45:30.</i></td>', 'Nice subject for black & white.  I''d try and straighten it out a little.  Everything is slipping to the right.', '2006-02-12 18:10:51.000000', '2006-02-17 21:45:30.000000', 1),
(2144972, 292729, 35545, '<td valign="top">To really carry this off, you  need to have both boats in sharp focus.  Good use of black &amp; white, but there seems to be a lot of noise.</td>', 'To really carry this off, you  need to have both boats in sharp focus.  Good use of black & white, but there seems to be a lot of noise.', '2006-02-12 18:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2144979, 292596, 35545, '<td valign="top">Original idea.  I wish you hands were in better focus. 6</td>', 'Original idea.  I wish you hands were in better focus. 6', '2006-02-12 18:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2145007, 291205, 37524, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.', '2006-02-12 18:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2145019, 291575, 37524, '<td valign="top">A little creepy, but I really love the colors and textures!  Good work.</td>', 'A little creepy, but I really love the colors and textures!  Good work.', '2006-02-12 18:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2145021, 292869, 37524, '<td valign="top">Love the colors in this photo.</td>', 'Love the colors in this photo.', '2006-02-12 18:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2145027, 290158, 37524, '<td valign="top">sad...</td>', 'sad...', '2006-02-12 18:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2145037, 292047, 5354, '<td valign="top">This has so much potential, but you have not given yourself even half a chance.<br/>Lets look at the background - too much going on, too much detail. Stop down to f2.8 or f4 to throw all that background out of focus.<br/>Next lets look at the light - bland and flat. Come back at dawn or dusk and get some sideways directional light to pick out the shapes.<br/>Composition - the main object is placed dead centre, remember the rule of thirds and look for an angle where you can make use of it.<br/> <br/>Last - that hint of blue keeps dragging my eye over the hill. Place your camera and viewpoint so that you do not have these distractions. Hide it behind one of the upright pieces.</td>', 'This has so much potential, but you have not given yourself even half a chance.Lets look at the background - too much going on, too much detail. Stop down to f2.8 or f4 to throw all that background out of focus.Next lets look at the light - bland and flat. Come back at dawn or dusk and get some sideways directional light to pick out the shapes.Composition - the main object is placed dead centre, remember the rule of thirds and look for an angle where you can make use of it. Last - that hint of blue keeps dragging my eye over the hill. Place your camera and viewpoint so that you do not have these distractions. Hide it behind one of the upright pieces.', '2006-02-12 18:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2145044, 289715, 5354, '<td valign="top">The image is very washed out - this can be fixed in an editing tool, but make sure your monitor is well calibrated first</td>', 'The image is very washed out - this can be fixed in an editing tool, but make sure your monitor is well calibrated first', '2006-02-12 18:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2145049, 289723, 5354, '<td valign="top">The number of times we see this type of image means it has to be something pretty special to get up there. This one - well I can see you are going for a high-key approach, but it hasn''t quite worked</td>', 'The number of times we see this type of image means it has to be something pretty special to get up there. This one - well I can see you are going for a high-key approach, but it hasn''t quite worked', '2006-02-12 18:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2145071, 289837, 5354, '<td valign="top">Sure its a record shot of a broken horse, but there is little else here which would interest anyone other than the owner of the toy. Try to think about how to present your idea better. Use the light, move it into a room where the light source is a single window. Put some effort into it and we will respond with higher votes.</td>', 'Sure its a record shot of a broken horse, but there is little else here which would interest anyone other than the owner of the toy. Try to think about how to present your idea better. Use the light, move it into a room where the light source is a single window. Put some effort into it and we will respond with higher votes.', '2006-02-12 19:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2145075, 292022, 5354, '<td valign="top">I suppose everyone has to try this shot at some point;-)<br/>Nice enough, but its running against some much better and original images.</td>', 'I suppose everyone has to try this shot at some point;-)Nice enough, but its running against some much better and original images.', '2006-02-12 19:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2145078, 292634, 5354, '<td valign="top">Shame this is such a small image. With the ful 640 it would stand a chance</td>', 'Shame this is such a small image. With the ful 640 it would stand a chance', '2006-02-12 19:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2145090, 289912, 5354, '<td valign="top">Trouble with ''out of focus on purpose'' is that you have not pushed it far enough. It simply irritates at this point.</td>', 'Trouble with ''out of focus on purpose'' is that you have not pushed it far enough. It simply irritates at this point.', '2006-02-12 19:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2145125, 292022, 32345, '<td valign="top">This is technically a very good picture, and it really meets the challenge. But, I''m only giving you a 6 because IMO this picture is being over exploited on this site. This is not a new idea, it has been done several times before on other challenges.</td>', 'This is technically a very good picture, and it really meets the challenge. But, I''m only giving you a 6 because IMO this picture is being over exploited on this site. This is not a new idea, it has been done several times before on other challenges.', '2006-02-12 19:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2145135, 289836, 32345, '<td valign="top">With a fourth person on the left and with a frame a little bit smaller I would have call this picture a "Masterpiece"... 10 from me, good luck.</td>', 'With a fourth person on the left and with a frame a little bit smaller I would have call this picture a "Masterpiece"... 10 from me, good luck.', '2006-02-12 19:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2145244, 292813, 48228, '<td valign="top">Very very good.....</td>', 'Very very good.....', '2006-02-12 20:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2145248, 292802, 48228, '<td valign="top">I really love this, as you can see that it has stood time really well, except for the aged and broken feel to the buildings. The overgrown grasses and shrubs add to it appearance, and its use by date.  The blue creek or river, really adds interest to the windswept country scene..... Well done..... This would have also suited the "COUNTRY LIFE ll" challenge as well.....</td>', 'I really love this, as you can see that it has stood time really well, except for the aged and broken feel to the buildings. The overgrown grasses and shrubs add to it appearance, and its use by date.  The blue creek or river, really adds interest to the windswept country scene..... Well done..... This would have also suited the "COUNTRY LIFE ll" challenge as well.....', '2006-02-12 20:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2145250, 291400, 48228, '<td valign="top">This works so well and I love how you have taken this image..... I really love the textures and the earthy contrasting colors.....</td>', 'This works so well and I love how you have taken this image..... I really love the textures and the earthy contrasting colors.....', '2006-02-12 20:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
