(2148311, 292112, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice foreground and background separation along with nice lighting. The subject is just so-so without being a very crisp sharp photograph.</td>', 'Nice foreground and background separation along with nice lighting. The subject is just so-so without being a very crisp sharp photograph.', '2006-02-13 19:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2148317, 292186, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very good photograph. I like the tight crop the tones and dof. Focus and lighting is nice. Great job</td>', 'Very good photograph. I like the tight crop the tones and dof. Focus and lighting is nice. Great job', '2006-02-13 19:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2148324, 291475, 22970, '<td valign="top">Your photograph lacks in contrast very flat. The processing does very little to bring out the subject. I would suggest more contrast. I wish you the best in this and future challenges.</td>', 'Your photograph lacks in contrast very flat. The processing does very little to bring out the subject. I would suggest more contrast. I wish you the best in this and future challenges.', '2006-02-13 19:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2148343, 292830, 41675, '<td valign="top">LOL - rofl - how great! I like the minimal color scheme and composition. Well done and good luck in the challenge. 9</td>', 'LOL - rofl - how great! I like the minimal color scheme and composition. Well done and good luck in the challenge. 9', '2006-02-13 19:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2148348, 292074, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of a performance however I feel it is a stretch on the challenge topic. You photograph is soft focus throughout and the lighting does very little to enhance the photo. A good photograph on it''s own but as far as this challenge I feel it falls a little short. I wish you the best in this and future challenges.</td>', 'Nice picture of a performance however I feel it is a stretch on the challenge topic. You photograph is soft focus throughout and the lighting does very little to enhance the photo. A good photograph on it''s own but as far as this challenge I feel it falls a little short. I wish you the best in this and future challenges.', '2006-02-13 19:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2148359, 292506, 22970, '<td valign="top">When I view a photograph that is almost a 1:1 macro I expect to see detail of the subject. I feel your subject lacks the detail to make it stand out. Seems like the focus is very soft. Maybe a second light source from the left would of helped. I wish you well in this and future challenges.</td>', 'When I view a photograph that is almost a 1:1 macro I expect to see detail of the subject. I feel your subject lacks the detail to make it stand out. Seems like the focus is very soft. Maybe a second light source from the left would of helped. I wish you well in this and future challenges.', '2006-02-13 20:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2148373, 292342, 22970, '<td valign="top">Focus kind of soft and the shadows are a bit distracting. I feel you subject is a stretch on the challenge theme but still fits. Good luck in this and future challenges.</td>', 'Focus kind of soft and the shadows are a bit distracting. I feel you subject is a stretch on the challenge theme but still fits. Good luck in this and future challenges.', '2006-02-13 20:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2148378, 292194, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and focus along with lighting. Good black and white.</td>', 'Nice contrast and focus along with lighting. Good black and white.', '2006-02-13 20:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2148381, 292548, 22970, '<td valign="top">I like the photograph but would of loved to see some sharpness and contrast with a slightly larger dof. As-is the photograph looks like it has been run through neat image or an equivalent program and I believe some pertinent details were lost that could of added to your image.</td>', 'I like the photograph but would of loved to see some sharpness and contrast with a slightly larger dof. As-is the photograph looks like it has been run through neat image or an equivalent program and I believe some pertinent details were lost that could of added to your image.', '2006-02-13 20:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2148384, 289810, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W tone and the focus is good. I would of liked to see just a bit of the face and the image larger.</td>', 'Nice B&W tone and the focus is good. I would of liked to see just a bit of the face and the image larger.', '2006-02-13 20:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2148397, 292191, 22970, '<td valign="top">Without your title I would of found it difficult to identify your subject. Very abstact for this challenge and your title. The way you presented it to us is still good with nice contrast and focus. You are showing us the rustic look with bolts but doing nothing to show us a broken boat. What I see is old wood with cracks and bubbling/cracking paint. I would suggest a full or mostly full view of the boat to bring your subject alive. Still a good shot.</td>', 'Without your title I would of found it difficult to identify your subject. Very abstact for this challenge and your title. The way you presented it to us is still good with nice contrast and focus. You are showing us the rustic look with bolts but doing nothing to show us a broken boat. What I see is old wood with cracks and bubbling/cracking paint. I would suggest a full or mostly full view of the boat to bring your subject alive. Still a good shot.', '2006-02-13 20:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2148403, 292367, 22970, '<td valign="top">A very large stretch on the challenge topic IMO. Good shot technically.</td>', 'A very large stretch on the challenge topic IMO. Good shot technically.', '2006-02-13 20:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2148435, 291428, 41675, '<td valign="top">I whole heartedly agree with your title. I like the composition and color treatment, but for me, had it been a bit more in focus, I would have scored it even higher.</td>', 'I whole heartedly agree with your title. I like the composition and color treatment, but for me, had it been a bit more in focus, I would have scored it even higher.', '2006-02-13 20:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2148456, 292544, 41675, '<td valign="top">Her gaze gives me the opposite impression of your title. She looks more seductive than broken innocence. Other than that, I like the composition. Image looks a bit on the magenta side, but it could be my monitor.</td>', 'Her gaze gives me the opposite impression of your title. She looks more seductive than broken innocence. Other than that, I like the composition. Image looks a bit on the magenta side, but it could be my monitor.', '2006-02-13 20:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
