(2148686, 290840, 52343, '<td valign="top">nice texture in the wood deck, but you lost the detail in the shadow of the pot</td>', 'nice texture in the wood deck, but you lost the detail in the shadow of the pot', '2006-02-13 21:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2148688, 292750, 30049, '<td valign="top">What a neat place.  Not cool that it''s falling down I guess, but as a photographer it is certainly a subject worth exploring.  Hope you grabbed some other angles/compositions at this location...<br/> <br/>The pine tree growing over the building adds a neat leading diagonal line to this.  Another angle that might have worked is a portrait oriented shot with the far right of the building isolated to include the tower.  Just a thought.<br/> <br/>Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'What a neat place.  Not cool that it''s falling down I guess, but as a photographer it is certainly a subject worth exploring.  Hope you grabbed some other angles/compositions at this location... The pine tree growing over the building adds a neat leading diagonal line to this.  Another angle that might have worked is a portrait oriented shot with the far right of the building isolated to include the tower.  Just a thought. Good luck with the challenge.', '2006-02-13 21:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
