(2148882, 291575, 75713, '<td valign="top">For me, the title is a bit of a stretch and doesn''t really work to demonstrate broken... having said that however, this photo is an excellent demonstration of broken.. as soon as I saw the dolls face I thought, it''s broken..... and this is a very interesting photo (ok maybe a bit disturbing) - the colors are wonderful.. the light in the dolls eyes contrast so well with her broken face, making the eyes alive.... I like the color framing her head too... this shot has a haunting quality imo</td>', 'For me, the title is a bit of a stretch and doesn''t really work to demonstrate broken... having said that however, this photo is an excellent demonstration of broken.. as soon as I saw the dolls face I thought, it''s broken..... and this is a very interesting photo (ok maybe a bit disturbing) - the colors are wonderful.. the light in the dolls eyes contrast so well with her broken face, making the eyes alive.... I like the color framing her head too... this shot has a haunting quality imo', '2006-02-13 23:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
