(2149144, 291205, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good piece of camera art. The DOF, the de-sat colour, the composition are all really good. Well done.</td>', 'Good piece of camera art. The DOF, the de-sat colour, the composition are all really good. Well done.', '2006-02-14 01:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149152, 290571, 45928, '<td valign="top">The distortion above the tree and the house really detract from a great picture. Oversharpened?</td>', 'The distortion above the tree and the house really detract from a great picture. Oversharpened?', '2006-02-14 01:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149154, 292484, 42984, '<td valign="top">Terrific subject and for one, the B&amp;W treatment looks appropriate and has been very well done. I am really impresed with the highlight on the top of the break and the contrast of the white fallen stone and the blackness of the hedge behind it. Through all of that you have maintained the texture and subtle colours of the marble in the bit left standing. The composition has let it down a bit in that the rest of the cemetary becomes a distracting background. Not sure how to beat that though. Could you have got a more neutral background from the rise behind the grave? Or perhaps even just crop it tighter. Unfortunately you''ve fallen foul of my pet-peeve, images not squared up. All you need to do is rotate to get your verticales correct. When you don''t do that, it gives the impression that you''ve been sloppy in your preparation</td>', 'Terrific subject and for one, the B&W treatment looks appropriate and has been very well done. I am really impresed with the highlight on the top of the break and the contrast of the white fallen stone and the blackness of the hedge behind it. Through all of that you have maintained the texture and subtle colours of the marble in the bit left standing. The composition has let it down a bit in that the rest of the cemetary becomes a distracting background. Not sure how to beat that though. Could you have got a more neutral background from the rise behind the grave? Or perhaps even just crop it tighter. Unfortunately you''ve fallen foul of my pet-peeve, images not squared up. All you need to do is rotate to get your verticales correct. When you don''t do that, it gives the impression that you''ve been sloppy in your preparation', '2006-02-14 01:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149156, 290083, 45928, '<td valign="top">I wish this were more in focus...</td>', 'I wish this were more in focus...', '2006-02-14 01:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149157, 292442, 42984, '<td valign="top">I love fallen over buildings (see my Off-Centre entry:) I have a feeling this would beeven more appealing in colour but am mindful that you made a concious decision to turn it into a mono image.</td>', 'I love fallen over buildings (see my Off-Centre entry:) I have a feeling this would beeven more appealing in colour but am mindful that you made a concious decision to turn it into a mono image.', '2006-02-14 01:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149158, 292381, 42984, '<td valign="top">I really looked for the broken wing, but can''t see it .. lol</td>', 'I really looked for the broken wing, but can''t see it .. lol', '2006-02-14 01:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149160, 291458, 42984, '<td valign="top">Excellent creative response to teh challenge. If you''d used the Rule of Thirds I think it would have had even more impact as it would benefit from the extra neutral white space. You might just get close to the front page with this entry - good luck.</td>', 'Excellent creative response to teh challenge. If you''d used the Rule of Thirds I think it would have had even more impact as it would benefit from the extra neutral white space. You might just get close to the front page with this entry - good luck.', '2006-02-14 01:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149162, 292874, 42984, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done and I do like the colouring. I find it perhaps a little too abstracted but am impressed by it as a piece of wall art</td>', 'Very nicely done and I do like the colouring. I find it perhaps a little too abstracted but am impressed by it as a piece of wall art', '2006-02-14 01:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149164, 292581, 42984, '<td valign="top">This is a great subject, the DOF is really good and the quality colour values in the wood and the light through the stings are all really good. I find the composition a little too centred and there''s something (a string?) angling from the head up to top-left. It really throws the perspective of the shot. It looks like a shadown and makes the image appear to be titlted.</td>', 'This is a great subject, the DOF is really good and the quality colour values in the wood and the light through the stings are all really good. I find the composition a little too centred and there''s something (a string?) angling from the head up to top-left. It really throws the perspective of the shot. It looks like a shadown and makes the image appear to be titlted.', '2006-02-14 01:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149165, 292359, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good macro, cool subject</td>', 'Good macro, cool subject', '2006-02-14 01:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149166, 291162, 42984, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and textures of this. I wish I could work out what this is ... and then I''d be able to work out what was broken.</td>', 'Love the colours and textures of this. I wish I could work out what this is ... and then I''d be able to work out what was broken.', '2006-02-14 01:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149169, 292613, 20324, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot. It is on the edge of being an abstract. Nice B&amp;W work! 9</td>', 'I like it a lot. It is on the edge of being an abstract. Nice B&W work! 9', '2006-02-14 01:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149175, 292443, 42984, '<td valign="top">Awesome subject, nice use of thirds for the window. I haven''t decided on the B&amp;W treatment yet but I have to mention the lack of straightening. The vertical of the window shoud be either vertical or way tilted, not just a degree and a half off like this. It gives the impression that ti''s a sloppy job or that you don''t care - neither of which are true I''m sure.</td>', 'Awesome subject, nice use of thirds for the window. I haven''t decided on the B&W treatment yet but I have to mention the lack of straightening. The vertical of the window shoud be either vertical or way tilted, not just a degree and a half off like this. It gives the impression that ti''s a sloppy job or that you don''t care - neither of which are true I''m sure.', '2006-02-14 01:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149178, 292554, 42984, '<td valign="top">Taht''s really good. The leading lines of the boat work for the composition.  The lighting and colours just work so well too. Of all things the yellow rocks really add something to this</td>', 'Taht''s really good. The leading lines of the boat work for the composition.  The lighting and colours just work so well too. Of all things the yellow rocks really add something to this', '2006-02-14 01:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149179, 292830, 42984, '<td valign="top">Cat pix usually get a thumbs-down from me ... but not this one, the setup and then the cat''s ''expression'' are priceless</td>', 'Cat pix usually get a thumbs-down from me ... but not this one, the setup and then the cat''s ''expression'' are priceless', '2006-02-14 01:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149180, 291400, 20324, '<td valign="top">Did you try this picture in B&amp;W? I would crop off the roof. The window and the texture of the wall makes it enough interesting and the roof just distracts.</td>', 'Did you try this picture in B&W? I would crop off the roof. The window and the texture of the wall makes it enough interesting and the roof just distracts.', '2006-02-14 01:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149182, 290159, 42984, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide about this. The B&amp;W treatment is really cool as is the lighting affect of the sky looking like a halo .. perhaps it''s that it is very centred that subtracts frm the wow-factor. Will come back and review</td>', 'I can''t decide about this. The B&W treatment is really cool as is the lighting affect of the sky looking like a halo .. perhaps it''s that it is very centred that subtracts frm the wow-factor. Will come back and review', '2006-02-14 01:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149183, 292733, 42984, '<td valign="top">Is it broken? sorry I don''t know enough about this stuff to be able to tell.</td>', 'Is it broken? sorry I don''t know enough about this stuff to be able to tell.', '2006-02-14 01:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149186, 292787, 42984, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset and setting, it just doesn''t look broken from back here. We only have the title to give us a hint</td>', 'Beautiful sunset and setting, it just doesn''t look broken from back here. We only have the title to give us a hint', '2006-02-14 01:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149187, 291591, 42984, '<td valign="top">This is a great abstract. The cnetre of the crack being right on thirds is just terrific.</td>', 'This is a great abstract. The cnetre of the crack being right on thirds is just terrific.', '2006-02-14 01:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149188, 292745, 20324, '<td valign="top">Technically well done but little bit to static and unnatural. Glass rarely break the way you presented it.</td>', 'Technically well done but little bit to static and unnatural. Glass rarely break the way you presented it.', '2006-02-14 01:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149190, 291899, 42984, '<td valign="top">Very broken, well found. The impact needed to score high isn''t there yet and I''m trying to figure out how you could get that. Perhaps it''s that it looks too lively and happy with nice bright colours - I don''t know. Sorry I can''t offer a solution.</td>', 'Very broken, well found. The impact needed to score high isn''t there yet and I''m trying to figure out how you could get that. Perhaps it''s that it looks too lively and happy with nice bright colours - I don''t know. Sorry I can''t offer a solution.', '2006-02-14 02:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149192, 290160, 42984, '<td valign="top">Is it broken, I just can''t quite see enough of the subject to tell but I really really liek the colours, textures and composition of this and would happily hang it on the wall.</td>', 'Is it broken, I just can''t quite see enough of the subject to tell but I really really liek the colours, textures and composition of this and would happily hang it on the wall.', '2006-02-14 02:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149194, 291953, 42984, '<td valign="top">Cool subject, there just seeems to be too many elements and they''re distracting from the core message. It took me ages to see that the building is roofless and still cannot see that for sure</td>', 'Cool subject, there just seeems to be too many elements and they''re distracting from the core message. It took me ages to see that the building is roofless and still cannot see that for sure', '2006-02-14 02:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149195, 292145, 20324, '<td valign="top">Crop of the pipe please. I like the mood of the picture and that it is in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Crop of the pipe please. I like the mood of the picture and that it is in B&W.', '2006-02-14 02:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149201, 290599, 20324, '<td valign="top">I feel horror in this picture. Well done. ...br..rr..rr I start to shiver.</td>', 'I feel horror in this picture. Well done. ...br..rr..rr I start to shiver.', '2006-02-14 02:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149318, 292554, 18073, '<td valign="top">This is a great subject and I would love the chance to shoot this.  You haven''t made the most of this opportunity IMO though.  The composition is to central and the light very plain.<br/> <br/>You could get lower and make more of the great rocks in the foreground and shoot either at dawn or dust and get some great light into the scene.</td>', 'This is a great subject and I would love the chance to shoot this.  You haven''t made the most of this opportunity IMO though.  The composition is to central and the light very plain. You could get lower and make more of the great rocks in the foreground and shoot either at dawn or dust and get some great light into the scene.', '2006-02-14 05:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149340, 291513, 49782, '<td valign="top">this one made me laugh out loud. interesting pic too, sometimes a white background can be boring but it is effective here.</td>', 'this one made me laugh out loud. interesting pic too, sometimes a white background can be boring but it is effective here.', '2006-02-14 06:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149384, 291028, 18073, '<td valign="top">Nice light, nice composition and fab detail.  Like this shot a lot, has a great mood too it</td>', 'Nice light, nice composition and fab detail.  Like this shot a lot, has a great mood too it', '2006-02-14 07:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
