(2149467, 292262, 48298, '<td valign="top">I really like this!  Fun title and great outdoor shot.  I''m giving you a 10, although I predict a cliche studio shot will win it.  ;)</td>', 'I really like this!  Fun title and great outdoor shot.  I''m giving you a 10, although I predict a cliche studio shot will win it.  ;)', '2006-02-14 08:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
