(2149666, 292110, 52971, '<td valign="top">not already broken, but then again, neither was mine. i like the texture on the  bottom surfcace, and i like the shadow and light hitting the top, it''s a very nice contrast. the color of the orange is perfect, and true to the real thing.</td>', 'not already broken, but then again, neither was mine. i like the texture on the  bottom surfcace, and i like the shadow and light hitting the top, it''s a very nice contrast. the color of the orange is perfect, and true to the real thing.', '2006-02-14 10:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149668, 291172, 52971, '<td valign="top">great composition. i love finding things so random like that. very plentiful where i live. good find. i like the lighting, and the angle suits the subject well. abstract, but not so much as to not know what you''re looking at. the darkness above the car gives a nice balance to the picture, if it had been lighter or darker, it wouldn''t be as easy to look at.</td>', 'great composition. i love finding things so random like that. very plentiful where i live. good find. i like the lighting, and the angle suits the subject well. abstract, but not so much as to not know what you''re looking at. the darkness above the car gives a nice balance to the picture, if it had been lighter or darker, it wouldn''t be as easy to look at.', '2006-02-14 10:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149669, 292290, 51974, '<td valign="top">so sad for the whiskey. nice image.</td>', 'so sad for the whiskey. nice image.', '2006-02-14 10:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149670, 292848, 52971, '<td valign="top">ooooo. very nice. i like the lines, and the easy to read numbers on the dial. the angle is a little too abstract, kind of annoying to look at it that way, but it is still good composition.</td>', 'ooooo. very nice. i like the lines, and the easy to read numbers on the dial. the angle is a little too abstract, kind of annoying to look at it that way, but it is still good composition.', '2006-02-14 10:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149675, 292769, 52971, '<td valign="top">it''s so dark, you can''t really tell it''s a building that caught on fire until you read the title to see what''s going on. i like the angles of the house, though, and how the point of the house is at the very top of the picture.</td>', 'it''s so dark, you can''t really tell it''s a building that caught on fire until you read the title to see what''s going on. i like the angles of the house, though, and how the point of the house is at the very top of the picture.', '2006-02-14 10:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149676, 292482, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great idea, nice elements of person, dogtags, and letter, and good expression.  Would be better with less processing, better midtones, and not-so-blown-out white letter.</td>', 'Great idea, nice elements of person, dogtags, and letter, and good expression.  Would be better with less processing, better midtones, and not-so-blown-out white letter.', '2006-02-14 10:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149677, 291817, 52971, '<td valign="top">whaaaaaaat. wow. it makes me want to just look at it. i usually don''t like fake  looking pictures, but this one is just so interesting. i loooove the white on white, and the sharp yellow (not too much, not too little). the only negative i can see is that these are not already broken, but who really cares, anyway. 10 from me.</td>', 'whaaaaaaat. wow. it makes me want to just look at it. i usually don''t like fake  looking pictures, but this one is just so interesting. i loooove the white on white, and the sharp yellow (not too much, not too little). the only negative i can see is that these are not already broken, but who really cares, anyway. 10 from me.', '2006-02-14 10:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149680, 292262, 52971, '<td valign="top">hahaaaa. that''s so cool. good idea. the antique qualities of the wooden bird make it okay for its head to be off like that, as opposed to newer birds straight from the store. i like the reflections (but who doesnt) and the green grass is just right. love it.</td>', 'hahaaaa. that''s so cool. good idea. the antique qualities of the wooden bird make it okay for its head to be off like that, as opposed to newer birds straight from the store. i like the reflections (but who doesnt) and the green grass is just right. love it.', '2006-02-14 10:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149682, 292558, 52971, '<td valign="top">would have liked to seen a little bit of color remaining on the car, it would bring it out more against the busy background. good find though. and i''m glad it''s centered b/c any other way i would have been distracted from it because everything is the same color.</td>', 'would have liked to seen a little bit of color remaining on the car, it would bring it out more against the busy background. good find though. and i''m glad it''s centered b/c any other way i would have been distracted from it because everything is the same color.', '2006-02-14 10:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149686, 292597, 52971, '<td valign="top">good idea. but, impossible because if that bone was broken, you wouldn''t be able to hold that device.</td>', 'good idea. but, impossible because if that bone was broken, you wouldn''t be able to hold that device.', '2006-02-14 10:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149687, 292552, 52971, '<td valign="top">that''s disgusting. but, a 10. eww.</td>', 'that''s disgusting. but, a 10. eww.', '2006-02-14 10:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
