(2150447, 290688, 27073, '<td valign="top">What great shot! Great contrast, Focus, and Lighting. Subject too!<br/>Bumping up..</td>', 'What great shot! Great contrast, Focus, and Lighting. Subject too!Bumping up..', '2006-02-14 17:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
