(2150456, 291458, 53321, '<td valign="top">Creative :)</td>', 'Creative :)', '2006-02-14 18:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150457, 292022, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great idea to break the filter, I also love Konador''s Shadow II entry. I have tried this subject and my experience is that it''s not worth to make it tilt a much (because of the round filter having a feeling of rolling away), I would rotate a bit to the left. I would also prefer a bit deeper DOF to get the bottom of the filter sharp as well - and more contrast on the letters.</td>', 'Great idea to break the filter, I also love Konador''s Shadow II entry. I have tried this subject and my experience is that it''s not worth to make it tilt a much (because of the round filter having a feeling of rolling away), I would rotate a bit to the left. I would also prefer a bit deeper DOF to get the bottom of the filter sharp as well - and more contrast on the letters.', '2006-02-14 18:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150459, 291240, 27073, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. I like it.</td>', 'Cool idea. I like it.', '2006-02-14 18:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150463, 291852, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the gradients and the composition, great subject. Though, I find it overexposed on the whites of the ball.</td>', 'I like the gradients and the composition, great subject. Though, I find it overexposed on the whites of the ball.', '2006-02-14 18:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150465, 292026, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Personally I think a little, pale shadow would be fine in the egg covers to break the continuousity of big white areas and DOF could be a little depper, to have the yellow middle sharp as well.</td>', 'Nice composition. Personally I think a little, pale shadow would be fine in the egg covers to break the continuousity of big white areas and DOF could be a little depper, to have the yellow middle sharp as well.', '2006-02-14 18:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150469, 290523, 27073, '<td valign="top">This is the worst picture I have ever seen! Technically this photo is dead!</td>', 'This is the worst picture I have ever seen! Technically this photo is dead!', '2006-02-14 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150478, 290688, 10858, '<td valign="top">Manny, this must be you! :-) I rcognized your beautiful model. I love the dignity of this photo, the holding of the hands, the eyes hopefully looking up, there is always hope. The red in the background reminds me to blood and suggest suffering. I suggest a 10 for this, and good luck, this must be a ribbon winner!</td>', 'Manny, this must be you! :-) I rcognized your beautiful model. I love the dignity of this photo, the holding of the hands, the eyes hopefully looking up, there is always hope. The red in the background reminds me to blood and suggest suffering. I suggest a 10 for this, and good luck, this must be a ribbon winner!', '2006-02-14 18:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150481, 292813, 10858, '<td valign="top">Woosh! Great capture of movements! I only wonder about the stick (growing out from the egg just before smashing) which I don''t really understand here. The composition, colours, wow factors are anyway spot on.</td>', 'Woosh! Great capture of movements! I only wonder about the stick (growing out from the egg just before smashing) which I don''t really understand here. The composition, colours, wow factors are anyway spot on.', '2006-02-14 18:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150483, 292091, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, I love the 3 colours greys, greens, reds. My favourite colours. :-) Motion capture is spot on, good luck!</td>', 'Great lighting, I love the 3 colours greys, greens, reds. My favourite colours. :-) Motion capture is spot on, good luck!', '2006-02-14 18:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150486, 292745, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great colours, clear focus, and a cool composition. The redish liquid adds a nice colour element to it. How do you, people, get glass so beautiful sharp?</td>', 'Great colours, clear focus, and a cool composition. The redish liquid adds a nice colour element to it. How do you, people, get glass so beautiful sharp?', '2006-02-14 18:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150488, 291817, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great idea and presentation. I simply love the light shades, great lighting!</td>', 'Great idea and presentation. I simply love the light shades, great lighting!', '2006-02-14 18:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150490, 292876, 10858, '<td valign="top">Poor one. I love trumpets. Colours are great, the greens work well with the dusty golds, and lighting is superb!</td>', 'Poor one. I love trumpets. Colours are great, the greens work well with the dusty golds, and lighting is superb!', '2006-02-14 18:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
