(2150800, 291852, 42984, '<td valign="top">Initially I couldn''t work out what it was. If I hadn''t been commenting (and therefore HAVING to work it out) I would have given it 1 and moved on.<br/> <br/>Because it''s not just the ball, but the backboard too, a wider cropping might have told the story more clearly. You obviously thought the mono colour treatment worked better, probably for that grungy, desolate look so you diddn''t have the benefit of the colour to clearly identify all the elements.</td>', 'Initially I couldn''t work out what it was. If I hadn''t been commenting (and therefore HAVING to work it out) I would have given it 1 and moved on. Because it''s not just the ball, but the backboard too, a wider cropping might have told the story more clearly. You obviously thought the mono colour treatment worked better, probably for that grungy, desolate look so you diddn''t have the benefit of the colour to clearly identify all the elements.', '2006-02-14 21:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
