(2150919, 290289, 42984, '<td valign="top">Now I''m usually against gratuitous B&amp;W, not here. this is perfect, niccely subdued and contrasted to show just enough to make me interested and qwant more. You have a talent.</td>', 'Now I''m usually against gratuitous B&W, not here. this is perfect, niccely subdued and contrasted to show just enough to make me interested and qwant more. You have a talent.', '2006-02-14 21:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
