(2150962, 292540, 42984, '<td valign="top">Lovely iconic country broken. I don''t know what its missing to give it wow factor, but it needs just a littl something. The subject itself is great. Perhaps it needs a different crop, some saturation or contrast play</td>', 'Lovely iconic country broken. I don''t know what its missing to give it wow factor, but it needs just a littl something. The subject itself is great. Perhaps it needs a different crop, some saturation or contrast play', '2006-02-14 21:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
