(2151094, 290523, 26045, '<td valign="top">This is a very poorly done photo for many reasons: 1, it isn''t appealing. 2, it''s neither here nor there, it''s got no relevance. 3, there''s no technique - composition, lighting, flattering angles, interesting assertions. 4, it''s a stretch! "his last breath" = "broken" doesn''t work. ultimately, it''s just not an attractive photo, which is why i scored it really low. sorry.</td>', 'This is a very poorly done photo for many reasons: 1, it isn''t appealing. 2, it''s neither here nor there, it''s got no relevance. 3, there''s no technique - composition, lighting, flattering angles, interesting assertions. 4, it''s a stretch! "his last breath" = "broken" doesn''t work. ultimately, it''s just not an attractive photo, which is why i scored it really low. sorry.', '2006-02-14 22:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
