(2151720, 290613, 37818, '<td valign="top">Sorry my comments refer to another version of this shot...Clearly I entered the wrong one :(<br/>Congrats to the other version of this that placed 7th!</td>', 'Sorry my comments refer to another version of this shot...Clearly I entered the wrong one :(Congrats to the other version of this that placed 7th!', '2006-02-15 01:11:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2151727, 292742, 18367, '<td valign="top">You are absolutely right... the photo does not warrant the lower scores, of one, two and three.  I found that the presence of the young man in the photo didn''t add to the image, and found the white behind him truly distracting.<br/> <br/>I would have preferred a different perspective on this image where only the broken portion, and the background wall were in view.<br/> <br/>Notwitstanding this, I did like it enough to score it a 7.<br/> <br/>Ray</td>', 'You are absolutely right... the photo does not warrant the lower scores, of one, two and three.  I found that the presence of the young man in the photo didn''t add to the image, and found the white behind him truly distracting. I would have preferred a different perspective on this image where only the broken portion, and the background wall were in view. Notwitstanding this, I did like it enough to score it a 7. Ray', '2006-02-15 01:13:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2151728, 292830, 20462, '<td valign="top">that deserves all the accolades.  The first time I have laughed at an image in a while.  Perfect.  Keep em coming.</td>', 'that deserves all the accolades.  The first time I have laughed at an image in a while.  Perfect.  Keep em coming.', '2006-02-15 01:13:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2151735, 292742, 36808, '<td valign="top">Okay, I''ll step up.  Please keep in mind these are my two cents ( don''t have no ribbon or nuthin'').  :)<br/>The image was technically good, but it didn''t grab me emotionaly.  I wanted just a bit more and in fact I think a close-up of the naked bricks would''ve drawn me more.   I think the youth detracts from the broken bricks (although you could''ve been relaying broken youth as well), but I''d prefer to have one focus (the bricks) and at a sharper angle.  <br/>Good pic tho.<br/>:)<br/></td>', 'Okay, I''ll step up.  Please keep in mind these are my two cents ( don''t have no ribbon or nuthin'').  :)The image was technically good, but it didn''t grab me emotionaly.  I wanted just a bit more and in fact I think a close-up of the naked bricks would''ve drawn me more.   I think the youth detracts from the broken bricks (although you could''ve been relaying broken youth as well), but I''d prefer to have one focus (the bricks) and at a sharper angle.  Good pic tho.:)', '2006-02-15 01:14:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2151749, 292680, 28742, '<td valign="top">Nice job, nice score, nice finish. Congrats on this shot, Cindi!</td>', 'Nice job, nice score, nice finish. Congrats on this shot, Cindi!', '2006-02-15 01:17:43.000000', NULL, 0),
