(2151792, 292830, 22046, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your fourth place. I think it should have gotten a ribbon. It was one of my very favorite. Good story and very funny. Good work.</td>', 'Congratulations on your fourth place. I think it should have gotten a ribbon. It was one of my very favorite. Good story and very funny. Good work.', '2006-02-15 01:30:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2151799, 290738, 36521, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes and comments!</td>', 'Thanks for the votes and comments!', '2006-02-15 01:32:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2151802, 292742, 5885, '<td valign="top">Got a 7 from me... I thought it was "border-line" for the challenge, but did fit the challenge. No points deducted here.<br/> <br/>My biggest gripe is the headphones, they''re somewhat distracting and take away from the otherwise classic feel this image has.<br/> <br/>I also like to see just a bit more shallow DoF.</td>', 'Got a 7 from me... I thought it was "border-line" for the challenge, but did fit the challenge. No points deducted here. My biggest gripe is the headphones, they''re somewhat distracting and take away from the otherwise classic feel this image has. I also like to see just a bit more shallow DoF.', '2006-02-15 01:32:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2151813, 292742, 19936, '<td valign="top">Scott - I''ve been in this position also, middle score with no commnets.  It is easy to ignore the middle ranks and only commnet on the best and worst.<br/> <br/>With that siad this was certainly not the worst. It suffered from many of the thungs already mentioned; overshapening, bright background, too much going on in the photo. It may have done better with a closer crop. I for one like the boy and got the relationship with the broken wall.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps as I''m certainly not a medal winner!</td>', 'Scott - I''ve been in this position also, middle score with no commnets.  It is easy to ignore the middle ranks and only commnet on the best and worst. With that siad this was certainly not the worst. It suffered from many of the thungs already mentioned; overshapening, bright background, too much going on in the photo. It may have done better with a closer crop. I for one like the boy and got the relationship with the broken wall. Hope this helps as I''m certainly not a medal winner!', '2006-02-15 01:34:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2151816, 292742, 10263, '<td valign="top">It certainly didn''t deserve the lower scores. I didn''t vote but I would have given it a 5. I don''t like the crop on the boy plus I''m not crazy about the wide border. I love the broken wall though.</td>', 'It certainly didn''t deserve the lower scores. I didn''t vote but I would have given it a 5. I don''t like the crop on the boy plus I''m not crazy about the wide border. I love the broken wall though.', '2006-02-15 01:35:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2151846, 292742, 36470, '<td valign="top">It''s definitely not a bad picture.  When I look at it, it doesn''t scream Broken, however.  My attention is all on the boy and the wall is easily overlooked.  I think this would make a nice b &amp; w print :)</td>', 'It''s definitely not a bad picture.  When I look at it, it doesn''t scream Broken, however.  My attention is all on the boy and the wall is easily overlooked.  I think this would make a nice b & w print :)', '2006-02-15 01:41:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2151854, 290688, 41337, '<td valign="top">85 people thought this was average to poor??? Those are 85 jealous people I''m guessing.</td>', '85 people thought this was average to poor??? Those are 85 jealous people I''m guessing.', '2006-02-15 01:43:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2151858, 290688, 46993, '<td valign="top">I''m sticking by my earlier comments.  This IS a ribbon winner.  Super photo! It''s a 10</td>', 'I''m sticking by my earlier comments.  This IS a ribbon winner.  Super photo! It''s a 10', '2006-02-15 01:45:15.000000', NULL, 0),
