(2151883, 292876, 10858, '<td valign="top">Eeek, I just read back my comment. I meant the poor for the trumpet, the photo is great! :-) It was late when I commented and may be misunderstood, but it''s about I like it and I feel sorry for the tumpet.</td>', 'Eeek, I just read back my comment. I meant the poor for the trumpet, the photo is great! :-) It was late when I commented and may be misunderstood, but it''s about I like it and I feel sorry for the tumpet.', '2006-02-15 01:50:31.000000', NULL, 0),
