(2152019, 292742, 37252, '<td valign="top">I scored this a 7....I liked it, but the bricks did look a little over-sharpened.</td>', 'I scored this a 7....I liked it, but the bricks did look a little over-sharpened.', '2006-02-15 02:16:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2152027, 291953, 10858, '<td valign="top">I guess the background is a bit busy, the vires are a bit distracting. The reds are very nice, and work well with the cold pale colours of the background. There are a few title addicts here and if the don''t find roof full of SKY, they will score lower. I would add a bit of desaturation to all colour channels, except reds, not much, just a bit.</td>', 'I guess the background is a bit busy, the vires are a bit distracting. The reds are very nice, and work well with the cold pale colours of the background. There are a few title addicts here and if the don''t find roof full of SKY, they will score lower. I would add a bit of desaturation to all colour channels, except reds, not much, just a bit.', '2006-02-15 02:17:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2152057, 291953, 16241, '<td valign="top">cute!  i like the contrast</td>', 'cute!  i like the contrast', '2006-02-15 02:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2152065, 292194, 36606, '<td valign="top">cool shot. Should have placed higher.</td>', 'cool shot. Should have placed higher.', '2006-02-15 02:30:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2152068, 292742, 28742, '<td valign="top">Didn''t vote this one, but would''ve utterly slammed it cuz I''m a grumpy old man who can''t stand these young punks and their headphones hanging around abandoned buildings doing stuff! <br/> <br/>j/k ;-)<br/> <br/>Woulda been a 5 from me. Technically it''s all good but doesn''t have any wow or emotional connection for me. Looks like it''s getting a lot of comments though! ;-P</td>', 'Didn''t vote this one, but would''ve utterly slammed it cuz I''m a grumpy old man who can''t stand these young punks and their headphones hanging around abandoned buildings doing stuff!  j/k ;-) Woulda been a 5 from me. Technically it''s all good but doesn''t have any wow or emotional connection for me. Looks like it''s getting a lot of comments though! ;-P', '2006-02-15 02:32:16.000000', NULL, 0),
