(2152487, 292022, 888, '<td valign="top">thanks for all your comments folks.<br/> <br/>The biggest problem most of you seemed to have was the choice of book, I did vaguely consider a romantic book but chose my java book for the folowing reasons:<br/> <br/>-I needed a nice thick book, this was the most appropriate book I could find<br/>-I don''t own any romantic books<br/>-I thought it was pretty apt, that me, a lonely single guy at Valentines spends time with programming books rather than reading love poems</td>', 'thanks for all your comments folks. The biggest problem most of you seemed to have was the choice of book, I did vaguely consider a romantic book but chose my java book for the folowing reasons: -I needed a nice thick book, this was the most appropriate book I could find-I don''t own any romantic books-I thought it was pretty apt, that me, a lonely single guy at Valentines spends time with programming books rather than reading love poems', '2006-02-15 05:36:14.000000', NULL, 0),
