(2163145, 292145, 5885, '<td valign="top">Very nice pic, well done. I see a few comments that want the pipe removed from the photo. I disagree. I''d actually prefer to see a bit more of the pipe to give the shot a bit more context. This is not a studio shot and strives to tell a story, so elliminating enviromental elements is contradictory to its purpose.</td>', 'Very nice pic, well done. I see a few comments that want the pipe removed from the photo. I disagree. I''d actually prefer to see a bit more of the pipe to give the shot a bit more context. This is not a studio shot and strives to tell a story, so elliminating enviromental elements is contradictory to its purpose.', '2006-02-19 11:14:49.000000', NULL, 0),
