(2168707, 290248, 332, '<td valign="top">Critique Club:<br/>The idea and subject is great. Looks reallllly old :) The only thing I can see that could have been done better is the post processing. More contrast in the picture would have made it even better in my opinion. I am wondering how it would look in bw but I like the brownish color so i''m not sure if i would like it better in bw. Good luck in future challanges. Best wishes, arnit</td>', 'Critique Club:The idea and subject is great. Looks reallllly old :) The only thing I can see that could have been done better is the post processing. More contrast in the picture would have made it even better in my opinion. I am wondering how it would look in bw but I like the brownish color so i''m not sure if i would like it better in bw. Good luck in future challanges. Best wishes, arnit', '2006-02-21 18:15:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2168718, 292595, 332, '<td valign="top">Critique Club:<br/>4.8 is wayyyy to low for this picture. The idea is good and the execution is good. The black background is just spot on and it really looks like a broken hand. People might have rated it higher if the hand was of an old lady or man and perhaps in bw. But I like it. Good luck in future challenges. Best wishes, arnit</td>', 'Critique Club:4.8 is wayyyy to low for this picture. The idea is good and the execution is good. The black background is just spot on and it really looks like a broken hand. People might have rated it higher if the hand was of an old lady or man and perhaps in bw. But I like it. Good luck in future challenges. Best wishes, arnit', '2006-02-21 18:18:20.000000', NULL, 0),
