(2205152, 292551, 47852, '<td valign="top">I have to agree with the other commenter here.  This shot is nothing more than a picture of a broken washing machine.  Taken from a normal angle and perspective with plain lighting.  Perhaps taking it from a different angle, or a close up of a particularly interesting part of the machine.  Or if there had been something nearby that helped to tell a story about where it came from or why it was there?  Some of the shots from this challenge were converted to a b/w, perhaps that could have worked here?</td>', 'I have to agree with the other commenter here.  This shot is nothing more than a picture of a broken washing machine.  Taken from a normal angle and perspective with plain lighting.  Perhaps taking it from a different angle, or a close up of a particularly interesting part of the machine.  Or if there had been something nearby that helped to tell a story about where it came from or why it was there?  Some of the shots from this challenge were converted to a b/w, perhaps that could have worked here?', '2006-03-06 17:41:59.000000', NULL, 0),
