(2601313, 290159, 16912, '<td valign="top">comment from my <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=336521&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">1-4-0</a>  thread...<br/> <br/>I remember voting on this (an 8). I would have voted higher but for the blown out sky, revisting it however I think the sky adds to the overall image of bleakness. I quite like the lean but thing rotation a degree or so to the right might have more impact? (I guess its not still there for a retake?)</td>', 'comment from my 1-4-0  thread... I remember voting on this (an 8). I would have voted higher but for the blown out sky, revisting it however I think the sky adds to the overall image of bleakness. I quite like the lean but thing rotation a degree or so to the right might have more impact? (I guess its not still there for a retake?)', '2006-07-08 19:51:46.000000', NULL, 0),
