(2790788, 292281, 9285, '<td valign="top">Hi Kelli...<br/>Will start with the photos you''ve recieved the least comments on.. Here goes..<br/> <br/>This would had been a great shot.. Try to give it a tighter crop taking away the blank space on right... <br/> <br/>Focus seemed to be on the wall.. try to adjust the focus on the subject which are the broken stuffs.<br/> <br/>You''ll need to improve on the B/W post processing here..<br/>Go daring on working the curves to give u a greater constrast... <br/> <br/>Hope this helps..</td>', 'Hi Kelli...Will start with the photos you''ve recieved the least comments on.. Here goes.. This would had been a great shot.. Try to give it a tighter crop taking away the blank space on right...  Focus seemed to be on the wall.. try to adjust the focus on the subject which are the broken stuffs. You''ll need to improve on the B/W post processing here..Go daring on working the curves to give u a greater constrast...  Hope this helps..', '2006-09-03 02:00:50.000000', NULL, 0),
