(3540725, 292830, 63269, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh! The expression on the cat''s face... is just HILARIOUS! I think part of what makes it so funny is that I am QUITE farmiliar with that expression myself... :) My own cat gives me that look at her dinner time, as if to say, "Why haven''t you fed me yet? What is your problem?" lol. A beautiful shot.</td>', 'This made me laugh! The expression on the cat''s face... is just HILARIOUS! I think part of what makes it so funny is that I am QUITE farmiliar with that expression myself... :) My own cat gives me that look at her dinner time, as if to say, "Why haven''t you fed me yet? What is your problem?" lol. A beautiful shot.', '2007-04-11 20:16:28.000000', NULL, 0);
