(3557596, 292772, 1717, '<td valign="top">this is so cool.  i have a doll that i gave a haircut to when i was a kid, too.  i found her at my mom''s not too long ago but i haven''t taken any pics of her yet because she''s nekkid...lol.  i need to find or make some clothes for her.  she has the coolest looking eyes...mildew has grown over them and they have turned completely white.  they look so creepy.  lol...suits me to a T.  this is a great shot, hon.  kinda creepy in a cool way. :)</td>', 'this is so cool.  i have a doll that i gave a haircut to when i was a kid, too.  i found her at my mom''s not too long ago but i haven''t taken any pics of her yet because she''s nekkid...lol.  i need to find or make some clothes for her.  she has the coolest looking eyes...mildew has grown over them and they have turned completely white.  they look so creepy.  lol...suits me to a T.  this is a great shot, hon.  kinda creepy in a cool way. :)', '2007-04-18 02:12:22.000000', NULL, 0),
