(4904585, 292091, 31535, '<td valign="top">Every now and then I like to browse through the challenges of some of the great photogs on this site. I like to see the progression from ordinary submissions to ribbon winning submissions. It gives me a sense of reality in that we all started somewhere, and by learning everyday, our photos can become better and better.<br/> <br/>Having said that, today I decided to browse through your submissions and BAM! my whole theory fly''s out the window. A red in just your first submission. Only fitting. :)<br/> <br/>Keep spitting out the winners. I enjoy looking.</td>', 'Every now and then I like to browse through the challenges of some of the great photogs on this site. I like to see the progression from ordinary submissions to ribbon winning submissions. It gives me a sense of reality in that we all started somewhere, and by learning everyday, our photos can become better and better. Having said that, today I decided to browse through your submissions and BAM! my whole theory fly''s out the window. A red in just your first submission. Only fitting. :) Keep spitting out the winners. I enjoy looking.', '2008-08-22 13:56:54.000000', NULL, 0);
